          "items": [
            "The All Seasons Collection is pleased to include this fabulous family getaway in our portfolio of distinctive homes all located in the town of Rosemary Beach includes private beach access. This comfortably chic first floor living area and open floor plan is perfect to enjoy sharing conversation and laughter with family and friends. Another incredible feature of this home is the outdoor living area, perhaps one of the largest in Rosemary featuring a 20x20 ft. pool, outdoor dinning area, gas grill, fire pit and a spot to have your own corn hole tournament. Private parking is a real plus, enough for four cars.<br>The French door entryway lends itself to a calming atmosphere filled with natural light, featuring a comfortable larger seating area, a chef style kitchen w/Subzero refrigerator, Wolf range, island seating for four and spacious dining area. One of the two ensuite king master bedrooms located on the first floor and features a soaking tub, double vanity sinks, larger walk-in shower and expansive closet. The over sized laundry room with storage and half bath are also conveniently located on this floor.<br>The grand staircase leading to the second floor is where the remaining three bedrooms are located: to include an expansive king bedded master ensuite with double vanity sinks and walk-in shower. The third King bedroom and four bedded bunk room that share a bath to include a tub/shower combination and two pedestal sinks. <br>Please feel free to contact us at anytime should you have any questions regarding this spectacular getaway.<br>Pool heating fee $400 per week",
